  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">正在寻找 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本？在此获取！</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wFQMVmz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"446\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?color=blueviolet&label=Discord&logo=Discord&logoColor=blueviolet&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"187\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/y3z0n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=LunaPixelStudios&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"172\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?color=blue&label=Follow&logo=Twitter&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"127\" height=\"25\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-villages-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC-Version-black?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"137\" height=\"26\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">没错！云端之上的村庄！探索天空中巨大而美丽的村落吧！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这些村庄会在你的世界中完全随机生成，且每座空中之城都将拥有独特的外观！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组目前正处于稳定开发阶段。每次更新都会添加新的村庄/内容。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>兼容数据包</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">数据包允许你以特定方式修改此模组。所有内容均可更改和配置。兼容数据包会将其他模组的方块、物品和生物添加到此模组中。要将其加入你的模组包，请安装 Global Packs 模组，并将它们放入你的 resourcepacks 文件夹。此外，你可以使用 Paxi 或 Open Loader 确保它们在创建世界时加载。请注意，如果你使用的是 CurseForge 启动器，建议将兼容数据包添加到 resourcepacks 文件夹中，以便 CurseForge 正确识别它们。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">以下官方兼容数据包目前已提供（截至 v1.0.4）：</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-waystones-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-graveyard-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">墓地 x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-supplementaries-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-farmers-delight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-bakery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Bakery x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-vinery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Vinery x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-candlelight-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Candlelight x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-beachparty-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Beachparty x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-brewery-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Brewery x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sky-villages-lets-do-herbal-brews-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Herbal Brews x 天空村庄</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/LunaPixel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x8xufcE.png\" width=\"1076\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>图片</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s47MBTf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KzcpaYS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aRlKszu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G4BOAHE.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EmGry5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/We7fyp4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"642\"></strong></span></p>",
